"closed_at":"2022-04-08T15:59:23Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Context\r\nThis is one of the bugs after [going through steps](https://www.notion.so/forem/Amy-Apr-8-Steps-to-verify-Listings-as-an-Extension-56128c2adcd145529b8c8f8b06c2207c) to verify if Listings turning into an extension works as expected.\r\n\r\n# Current behavior\r\n\r\nThe Rate limit for Listings in `/admin/customization/config` doesn't show/hide according to the on/off status of Listings as an extension.\r\n<img width=\"1294\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-03-29 at 2 30 27 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/11730007/162394729-93288e8b-f5e3-41d8-b547-dd1df1e25872.png\">\r\n\r\n# Expected behavior\r\n\r\nThe Rate limit for Listings in `/admin/customization/config`  should show/hide according to the on/off status of Listings as an extension. When turned on, the configuration should be visible; when turned off, the \r\nconfiguration should disappear.\r\n\r\n# Steps to recreate\r\n\r\nFollow the `Before you start` section [here](https://www.notion.so/forem/Test-plan-Hiding-Listings-7c8141d6cfff46cb908dc3366c7f0a98), and then turn Listings off and on using Canary 1 to see current behavior.","closed_by":{"login":"jeremyf","id":2130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf","html_url":"https://github.com/jeremyf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeremyf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/17175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/17175/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}